[2026-11-16T10:21:14.786Z] [document-st-fbebd7] [stop=end_turn] [response] {"thought":"Both deliverables are written and verified: the full regression gate now exits 0 (typecheck + 283 unit tests + 40 smoke assertions), so defect0003 is genuinely fixed rather than masked. `.xcoder/blueprint.md` was created (it did not exist before) and `xcoder-dojo/CHANGELOG.md` records what changed, why, and how to roll back. I self-checked for broken Markdown tables and confirmed concrete anchors are present in both files.","action":null,"final_answer":{"summary":"Documented the xcoder-dojo TypeScript build in two artifacts and verified the claims against a running gate rather than asserting them.\n\n1. **`.xcoder/blueprint.md` — CREATED (13.9 KB, 257 lines).** This file did not exist; a reindex + a `Get-ChildItem -Force .xcoder -Recurse` confirmed the `.xcoder/` directory held backlog, defects, logs, tasks and indices but no blueprint. The new document covers: what the project is and what was cut (NG-01..NG-10); the three-layer architecture (`src/contracts/`, `src/backend/`, `src/ui/`) with a per-module responsibility table; the `DojoBridge` surface as 11 named sub-APIs plus `subscribe`; the 7-step end-to-end workflow; a safety-property table mapping each control to the file that enforces it; real runtime constants; verification status; and defect0003 with its lesson.\n\n2. **`xcoder-dojo/CHANGELOG.md` — CREATED (5.9 KB).** Changelog entry in the shape the docs skill asks for: what changed, why, fixed-during-task, verification commands with output, rollback, and gotchas.\n\nDocumentation is specific, not boilerplate: it cites `APPROVAL_TTL_MS = 120_000`, `DEFAULT_LIMITS = { maxTurns: 5, maxInputChars: 4_000, requestCapPerHour: 40 }`, `maxFileReadBytes = 200_000`, `auditRetentionDays = 30`, audit dir `.xcoder/logs/audit`, the exact 11-tool allowlist, the exact credential filename patterns, and the 283/40 test totals.\n\nThree corrections came out of writing it rather than copying prior summaries:\n- The README was truncated mid-sentence at 'images become `blocke…'`, so I read `backend/markdown.ts` directly. Images become `blocked-image` spans and raw HTML blocks are stripped, and both are **counted** (`blockedImages`, `strippedHtmlBlocks`) — that counter detail was not in any upstream summary.\n- Markdown table cells containing raw pipes (`id_rsa|ed25519|ecdsa`, `api_key|token|password`) silently split the table; both are now escaped/rewritten.\n- I checked the requirements text against the code before repeating it: the requirement described the toolset partly by name, so I read `ALLOWLISTED_TOOLS` in `models-execution.ts` to confirm the shipped list is exactly the 11 declared.\n\nOn verification: I re-ran the gate myself instead of trusting the upstream report. `tsc --noEmit` is clean, `vitest` gives 12 files / 283 tests in 1.53 s, and the smoke suite prints `40 passed, 0 failed` **and exits 0 on its own** — the exit is the part that was broken, so I confirmed it separately and then ran full `npm run regression`, which now returns exit 0. The blueprint records the fix precisely: `ApprovalTicket` carries an optional `timer`, `requestApproval` stores it and `unref()`s it feature-detected, and `approval.respond` calls `clearTimeout(ticket.timer)` before deleting the ticket.\n\nI also carried forward two non-obvious runner traps that cost upstream time, because they will bite the next person: `src/main.tsx` is a file so a `FOLDER_SCOPE` glob of `src/main.tsx/**/*.test.ts` zeroes the entire vitest run, and `npx --prefix` does not change cwd so vitest must be invoked from inside `xcoder-dojo/`.","deliverable":{"files_created":[{"path":".xcoder/blueprint.md","bytes":13936,"lines":257,"note":"Did not previously exist; created by this subtask. Architecture, workflow, feature inventory, safety-enforcement map, verification status, defects, conventions."},{"path":"xcoder-dojo/CHANGELOG.md","bytes":5906,"note":"What changed / why / fixed-during-task / verification / rollback / gotchas."}],"blueprint_sections":["1. What this is (incl. NG-01..NG-10 out-of-scope and the no-import-from-Python-reference rule)","2. Architecture — 3 layers, per-module table, DojoBridge 11 sub-APIs, BridgeEvent channel, src/main.tsx boot contract","3. Feature inventory — P-00..P-12 mapping table plus real runtime limits/defaults","4. Workflow — the 7-step loop from workspace.open to approval-gated write","5. Safety properties — property to enforcing-file table (S-03..S-13, PRM/AI controls)","6. Verification status — commands, 283 tests / 40 smoke assertions, two runner traps","7. Known defects — defect0003 timeline, root cause, fix, lesson","8. Conventions — provenance headers, no-any, S-12/S-13"],"concrete_specifics_cited":["APPROVAL_TTL_MS = 120_000 (demo-bridge.ts)","DEFAULT_LIMITS = maxTurns 5, maxInputChars 4_000, requestCapPerHour 40 (store.ts)","maxFileReadBytes = 200_000","auditRetentionDays = 30; audit log dir .xcoder/logs/audit","11-tool allowlist: list_dir, glob, grep, read_file, read_multiple_files, read_file_lines, read_outline, validate_file, git_status, git_diff, git_log","Credential patterns: .env*, *.pem, *.key, id_rsa/ed25519/ecdsa, .npmrc, .netrc, credentials(.json), secrets.*","Excluded dirs: node_modules, dist, build, .git, .xcoder","encoding 'utf-8' | 'utf-8-bom'; eol 'lf' | 'crlf' (AC-04 save fidelity)","tree.listChildren cursor paging, truncated past 1500 entries","themes dojo-dark/dojo-hud/dojo-light; model local-stub/dojo-local-7b; CLI label xcoder-agent-cli","markdown counters strippedHtmlBlocks and blockedImages","test totals: 12 files / 283 tests; smoke 40 passed, 0 failed"],"documented_defect":{"id":"defect0003","severity":"high","title":"Approval expiry timer leaked, hanging any Node process using the bridge","symptom":"npm run regression printed '40 passed, 0 failed' then hung at ~0.09s CPU and timed out","root_cause":"requestApproval() armed a 120s timer and discarded the handle; approval.respond removed the ticket without clearTimeout, so the orphan timer held the event loop for the full TTL","fix":"ApprovalTicket.timer + clearTimeout(ticket.timer) in approval.respond + feature-detected unref(); expiry callback re-reads the ticket instead of a captured closure","rca":" .xcoder/defects/defect0003.md","lesson_documented":"A passing assertion set is not a passing gate — a process that will not exit is a failure; long-lived timers must be cancellable AND unref()d."},"verification_notes":{"corrections_made_while_documenting":["README truncated mid-sentence at 'images become blocke…'; read backend/markdown.ts instead — images become blocked-image spans and HTML blocks are stripped, both counted, a detail absent from upstream summaries.","Raw pipe characters inside Markdown table cells (id_rsa|ed25519|ecdsa, api_key|token|password) were splitting tables; escaped/rewritten and re-checked column uniformity.","Re-read ALLOWLISTED_TOOLS rather than paraphrasing the requirements, confirming the shipped list is exactly 11 tools."],"runner_traps_recorded":["src/main.tsx is a FILE, so FOLDER_SCOPE glob src/main.tsx/**/*.test.ts matches nothing and zeroes the vitest run; coverage lives at src/ui/__tests__/main-entry.test.ts.","npx --prefix does not change cwd and breaks --config resolution; invoke vitest from inside xcoder-dojo/."]},"files_touched":[".xcoder/blueprint.md","xcoder-dojo/CHANGELOG.md"],"self_check":{"ran":true,"passed":true,"detail":"From inside xcoder-dojo: `npm run typecheck` clean; `npx vitest run --config vitest.config.ts` → 12 test files passed, 283 tests passed in 1.53s; `npm run test:smoke` → 40 passed, 0 failed, EXIT:0 (process self-terminated — the previously failing condition). Then full `npm run regression` from inside xcoder-dojo → 40 passed, 0 failed, REGRESSION EXIT:0. Documented assertions were also spot-checked programmatically against file contents (demo-bridge.ts, defect0003, DEFAULT_LIMITS, requestCapPerHour: 40, DojoBridge, P-12 all present in the